msgstr "Connexion…"

msgid "Connection help"
msgstr "Aide à la connexion"

msgid "Could not open your browser."
msgstr "Impossible d'ouvrir votre navigateur."

msgid "Could not reach Undertrained to refresh. Showing the list from the last successful load."
msgstr "Impossible de joindre Undertrained pour actualiser. Affichage de la liste du dernier chargement réussi."

msgid "Could not reach Undertrained"
msgstr "Impossible de joindre Undertrained"

msgid "Could not save your devices."
msgstr "Impossible d'enregistrer vos appareils."

